id: og_arcology_b
name: Arcology II
description: Arcology. A residential block whose shopping deck, terrace and service undercroft are stacked in twelve metres, and every one of them overlooks a level it cannot reach. Built as a mixed-use housing block; the block was evacuated floor by floor and the lifts were locked out behind them.

